cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "The Refusal Stack"
abstract: >-
  An empirical study that locates the linear refusal direction in an open-weight
  LLM, attacks it across threat models, strips it with a covert LoRA fine-tune,
  and detects the tampering from generation-time activations — then tests whether
  the same locate/break/detect method holds across a second model, a second
  modality, and a second behaviour. Replicates GCG (Zou et al. 2023), PAIR
  (Chao et al. 2023), and the refusal direction (Arditi et al. 2024).
type: software
